# Deep Search ADK - Environment Variables Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual API keys

# ============================================================================
# REQUIRED - CrewAI Multi-Agent System
# ============================================================================

# OpenAI API Key (Required for CrewAI agents)
# Get your key from: https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ============================================================================
# OPTIONAL - Additional Search and Research APIs
# ============================================================================

# Serper API Key (for Google search integration)
# Get your key from: https://serper.dev/
SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_api_key_here

# Tavily API Key (for AI-powered search)
# Get your key from: https://tavily.com/
TAVILY_API_KEY=your_tavily_api_key_here

# SerpAPI Key (for search engine results)
# Get your key from: https://serpapi.com/
SERPAPI_API_KEY=your_serpapi_api_key_here

# ============================================================================
# USAGE NOTES
# ============================================================================

# For Deep Search Multi-Agent System:
#   python main.py
#   Requires: OPENAI_API_KEY

# Optional: Add search API keys to enhance research capabilities
# The system will work with just OpenAI, but search APIs provide better results

# Security Best Practices:
#   - Never commit .env file to version control
#   - Rotate API keys regularly
#   - Set spending limits in provider dashboards
#   - Use separate keys for development and production
#   - Review API usage and costs monthly
